; Freeciv: the server alone, headless. Three AI players play five turns on
; a small classic map, saving each turn; -e ends the server with the game.
; Times and the log go to RAM:FreecivServer.log. Run it in the Freeciv drawer.
FailAt 21
Stack 1000000
Date
freeciv-server -e -r autogame.serv -p 5599 -b 127.0.0.1 -l RAM:FreecivServer.log -d 2 --nometa
Echo "freeciv-server returned"
Date
List User/saves
